      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1914-05-23_WidnesExaminer_art0177" n="art0177">
        <head>DOCTORS ADVISE OPERATIONS</head>
        <p>DOCTORS ADVISE OPERATIONS</p>
        <p>Avoidedby Lydia E. Pinicham's Vegetable Compound.</p>
        <p>" For fifteen years I suffered excessively, and for nearly two years I had hemorrages and the doctors told me I would have to indergo a surgical operation, but I began taking Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound and am in good health now. I cannot praise your 7egetable Compound too highly. Every woman should take it at middle life. I</p>
        <p>it to both old and young for female ailments." (Name and address on request).</p>
        <p>Another Operation Escaped.</p>
        <p>"My troubles began with the loss of a child, and I had hemorrhages for four months. The doctors said a surgical operation was necessary, but I dreaded it and decided to try Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound. The medicine has made me a healthy woman and I feel .strong and do my own work." (Name and address on request.) _</p>
        <p>Since we guarantee that all testimonials which we publish are genuine, is .it not fair to suppose that if Lydia E. Pinkham's Vegetable Compound has the virtue to help these women it will help any othet woman who is suffering in a like manner'. Write to-day for a free private book (to • women only) to the Lady Manager, the Lydia E.") Pinkham Medicine Co., 42a Hampstead Road, London' N.W. For 2s. 9d. she will send you a bottle of the Lydia E. Pinkham Vegetable Compound, or for 4s. 6d. a much larger bottle. Any chemist will supply it at these figures.</p>
