        <p>MATCHES FOR TO-DAY. 2.15.—5 t. Austin's D v. Whitecross D. 2.45.—5 t. John's A v. Howley D. 3.ls.—Fairfield E v. Howley B. 3.4s.—Whitecross B v. Orford A. 4.ls.—Whitecross J v. Fairfield D. 4.45.—5 t. John's C v. Whitecross C. 5.15.—T0wn ITall B v. St. Austin's B. s.4s.—Whitecross Fv. 13ewscly B. • 6.ls.—Orford 1) v. Fairfield G. 6.45.—5 t. Austin's C v. Fairfield F. 7.15.—T0wn Hall D v. Fairfield C. On and after to-day only half an hour will be allowed for each match.</p>
        <p>The following are the games for next Satur- day :- 2.ls.—Fairfield B v. Orford C. 2.4s.—Whltecl'osB E V. Latchford A. 3.ls.—Orford E v. Latchford C.</p>
