        <p>Warrington. v. Stockport.</p>
        <p>Stockport.—J. C. Fallows c Duckworth b Par- tridge 2, J. Parkinson b Hannam 16, J. S. Cragg c Bennett b Hannam 12, S. R. V. Stockdale b Hannam 0, G. A. Baker lbw b Bennett 1, Wil- liams b Hannam 11, W. A. Cragg h Hannam 13, B. Horner c Duckworth b Bennett 5, F. W. Archer lbw b Hannam 0, A. V. Firth b Bennett 2, Tipping not out 0, extras 5; total 68. Warrington.—W. Richardson b Archer 5, S. L. Partridge st Tipping b Williams 38, J. S. Broome 1) Williams 2, H. Hawthorn e Stockdale b Wil- liams 12, J. Thompson c and b Williams 2, J. C. Bradburn c W. Cragg b Williams 0, B. Silcock b Firth 24, S. Baxter c W. Cragg b Williams 5, Hannam b Firth 36, A. Duckworth not out 6, W. Bennett b J. S. Cragg 6, extras 6; total 144. Warrington 2nd v. Stockport 2nd.</p>
