        <p>Emmanuel v. Winwick Asylum. At Winwick. Scores :</p>
        <p>Emmanuel.—S. Hughes b Hilton 0, W. Knight run out 23, T. Hughes b Dawson 5, J. Bibby b Hilton 18, C. Harrison b Hilton 0, A. Hughes c Dr. Stone b Hilton 1, P. Broadhurst c Walker f. b Cunningham 0, W. Bibby lbw 6, W. Eaton 1) Hilton 2, T. A. Knight not out 7, Walter Eaton c Walker b Hilton 0; extras 3; total 65. Winwick Asylum.—W. R. Walker c W. Bibby b•A. Hughes 22, E. Fawcett b S. Hughes 0, P. Hilton c T. Hughes b A. Hughes 2, J. Dawson c J. Bibby b S. Hughes 4, W. A. Simpson not out 4, C. Cunningham b A. Hughes 10, J. Walsh b A. Hughes 0, Dr. Stone lbw 0, J. Renward c W. Bibby b A. Hughes 7, L. C. Ashley b, S. Hughes 1, Dr. Wilkins c W. Bibby I) S. Hughes 0; extras 4; total 54.</p>
        <p>Bold-street Wesleyans v. Elmwood Avenue Congregational. _</p>
        <p>Played on the groLd. of the latter. Scores : Bold-street Wesleyans.—C. W. Healey lbw b Corlett 5, W. Cooper c Hazeldine b Corlett 0, W. Stringer b J. Phoenix 5, W. W. Westwell b J. Phoenix 0, L. W. Weaver b J. Phoenix 12. T. W. Peacock run out 4, F. A. Day b Beardsall 1, F. W. Taylor b Beardsall 0, T. Gartland b Beardsall 3, F. D. Taylor run out 7, A. J. Oreenhalgh not out 1; extras 3; total 41. Elmwood Avenue Congregational.—J. Phoenix c Westwell b Weaver 0, F. Molyneux c Peacock b Stringer 1, J. Beardsall b Stringer 0, J. Pritchard 13 Weaver 0, H. Hazeldine b Weaver 0, J. Phoenix c and b Weaver 0, J. Mellor b Weaver 2. W. Phoenix run out 3, H. Corlett not out 2, F. Hughes c Healey b Weaver 0, H. Clay- ton c Healey b Stringer 1; extras 1; total 10. Bold-street Wesleyans v. Wycliffe, at Arpley, to-day.</p>
        <p>Rylands Bros.' 2nd XI. v. Working Men's</p>
        <p>Mission.</p>
        <p>At Arpley. Scores : Working Men's Mission.—S. Lloyd c Potter b Wadworth 18, E. Hughes c Warren b Byrom 0, P. Boyd c Scarisbrick b Potter 2, W. Eccleston c Byrom b Potter 3, W. Appleton b Potter 10, H. Oakley b J. Garraty 1, H. Eccleston not out 0, .T. O'Niel run out 8, H. Walker c and b Wad- worth 1, J. M'Garr b Wadworth 5, R. Kirby h Garraty 0, extras 1; total 49. Rylands'.—F. Potter b S. Lloyd 3, J. O'Brien b S. Lloyd 2, E. Byrom run out 0, P. Wadworth c and b J. M'Garr 0, H. Hicks b J. M'Garr 0, J. Garraty b J. M'Garr 5, J. Burley c W. Ecclesten. b S. Lloyd 3, T. Scarisbrick b J. M'Garr 0, A. Holt b J. M'Garr 0, J. Warren not out 0, W. Whittle b J. M'Garr 0, extras 1; total 14. _ . __</p>
        <p>For the Mission J. M'Garr took: six wickets for six runs.</p>
