        <p>INSURANCE</p>
        <p>1, SUEZ-STREET, WARRINGTON. SALES BY AUCTION, VALUATIONS FOR BALE, MORTGAGE OR PROBATE, ESTATES MANAGED. Insurances of every description immediately arranged. Telephone 308.</p>
        <p>ROBERT LOWE. ESTATE AGENT, AUCTIONEER &amp; VALUER. MARKET GATE SALEROOMS, 5, BUTTER- MARKET-STREET, WARRINGTON. Weekly Sales every Wednesday afternoon. Telephone No. 55. Consignments invited.</p>
