        <p>15. BOLD-STREET, WARRINGTON. Tel. 228.</p>
        <p>Mr. FRANK HICKM.AN.</p>
        <p>MARKET SALE. MONDAY, MAY 25th. 33 Pairs BOOTS and SHOES, New and Second-hand CLOTHING, SHIRTS, HOUSE- HQLD FURNITURE, BICYCLE, and the usual Sinoplies. 2 o'clock. No Reserve. Auctioneer: FRANK HICKMAN.</p>
