        <p>------• — Hotel Hydro, near XI-Baths; Billiards; very moderate terms. Tel. 272 VI-ARROGATE. Kingsley Hotel-Pension, -LI- Cold Bath-road. Central. Very moderate terms. Tel. 272.</p>
        <p>J-•-- ERSEY.—Star Hotel, Facing the Harbour; moderate inclusive terms.—Full particulars Poet free.—Raynor Smith, proprietor. LYTI-IDS.—Ailey Private Hotel; Prom.; every convenience; families and parties specially catered for; private room. Tel. 23.—Mrs. Crook. MORECAMBE. Bradford Arms Hotel, minute from Railway Station and Prom.; Catering for Picnic and Choir Parties a speciality. Menu and Terms on Application. PORTRUSH.—Come to " Skerry Bhan " and see Ulster; sea front; best position; good catering; 40 bedrooms; moderate charge. Tel. 28.- 3, Lansdowne Crescent, Portrush. ST7—AN—NE—S.—Clifton Private Hotel, prom.; facing Bandstand; near links, tennis, croque Tel. 289.</p>
        <p>COLWYN BAY.—llomely Apartments, on level; close to sea, station and pier.—Howarth, 42, Erskine-road.</p>
        <p>BAXTEAU, Magical Entertainer ; Concerts, etc., attended; juvenile parties a speciality; terms moderate.-6, Marsh-street, Warrington.</p>
