        <p>AUSTRALIA FOR £2 DOWN, and £5 10s. by easy instalments after arrival. Young men, 16 to 20, of good character, sound health, placed on Farms in Queensland. Wages from 12s. 6d. all found. CANADA.—Farm Situations Guaranteed to men 18 to 40, with experience and good refer- ences. Small loans towards fares. Apply: OIiIIRCH ARMY EMIGRATION DEPARTMENT, 65, BRYANSTON-STREET, LONDON, W.</p>
