        <p>THE RURAL DisTRIcT COUNCIL OF RUNCORN. PAINTING. ISOLATION lIOSPITAL, DUTTON. The above Council invite TENDERS for the internal and external PAINTING of their In- fectious Diseases Hospital at Dutton, near Preston Brook. Specification and Form of Tender may be obtained from the Council's Architerts, Messrs. Wright and Hamlyn, Sankey-street Chambers, Warrington. Sealed tenders endorsed "Tender for Paint- ing" to be delivered to the undersigned not later than Monday, the Ist day of June, 1914. The Council do not bind themselves to accept the lowest or any tender. GEO. F. ASHTON, " Clerk to the Council. 71, High-street, Runcorn, 20th May, 1914.</p>
